    "text": "ん……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "弟子",
    "text": "（テーブルにあるペットボトル、\r\n妙に汗をかいてるな……？）",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 4901032130050,
    "speaker": "にちか",
    "text": "……うわ\r\nいきなり女子の部屋見まくるの、怖すぎなんですけど……",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "nichika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "charType": "idols",
    "charId": "1040240010",
    "charPosition": {
      "x": 568,
      "y": 640,
      "order": 0
    },
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "from",
      "alpha": 0,
      "time": 100
    },
    "se": "0327",
    "voice": "special_communications/490103213/4901032130050"
  },
  {
    "charAnim1": "wait",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp_s",
    "charLabel": "nichika",
    "textFrame": "off",
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "to",
      "alpha": 0,
      "time": 100
    }
  },
  {
    "speaker": "弟子",
    "text": "いや、テーブルの上に乗ってるペットボトル\r\n凍らせてるのかな、って思ったんですよ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "弟子",
    "text": "冷凍庫には何も入れてなかったと思うんですが……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 4901032130060,
    "speaker": "美琴",
    "text": "『Ａ』の冷蔵庫から一本いただいてきたの",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger1",
    "charLabel": "mikoto",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "charType": "idols",
    "charId": "1040250010",
    "charPosition": {
