    "fgEffectTime": 500,
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 2000
  },
  {
    "id": 4901032130220,
    "speaker": "美琴",
    "text": "でも、こんな風に人目を忍んで行動するのが\r\nこの時刻っていうのも、おかしいんじゃない？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "special_communications/490103213/4901032130220"
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "弟子",
    "text": "確かに……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "弟子",
    "text": "遺体を私が見つけたのは今朝のことです",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "弟子",
    "text": "この時点では、犯人以外\r\n『Ａ』が死んでいることを知らないはず……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 4901032130230,
    "speaker": "にちか",
    "text": "……ですよね",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "special_communications/490103213/4901032130230"
  },
  {
    "id": 4901032130240,
    "speaker": "にちか",
    "text": "和泉さんに、\r\n事情を聞かせてもらったほうがよさそう……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "special_communications/490103213/4901032130240"
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off",
    "bg": "00378",
